{# The text the customer typed on a customizable option, under the order line that option
   became. The order keeps the option's name on that line but not its content, so this is
   the only place it can be read back.

   Only classes the theme already emits: a module template is not scanned by the theme's
   Tailwind (@import "tailwindcss" source(none) in assets/styles/app.css). #}
{% set d = 'option' %}

<p class="mt-1 mb-6 paragraph-6 text-grey">
    {{- 'Your customization:'|trans({}, d) }} <span class="text-grey-dark">{{ value }}</span>
</p>
